                <head>42. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On September 13, 1961, SIOP-62 was briefed to
                    President Kennedy. (Enclosure to JCS 2056/281, September 13; National Archives and
                    Records Administration, RG 218, JCS Records, CCS 3105 Joint Planning (13 September
                    1961)) A partially declassified text is printed in International Security,
                    Summer 1987 (12:1), pages 41-51. For information on the origins of SIOP-62, see <ref target="frus:frus1958-60v03/d1"
                            ><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1958–1960, volume III,
                        Documents 1ff</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
